to the deep blue of Hokusai\u2019s gallery, each virtual museum has its own palette, sky and architecture inspired by the artist\u2019s style.\n\nExplore more than 20 works by each artist and follow the course of their artistic career. See how their style changed, spot recurring themes and learn about the world in which each work was created.\n\nThe collection includes over 400 artwork analyses in English, French, Spanish and Italian. Pause to look closely at a detail, compare two works or take the full tour at your own pace.\n\nINTO the ART - MUSEUM is an official part of the INTO the ART art community on Meta Quest.", "short_description": "Step into the virtual museums of INTO the ART - MUSEUM, an official part of the INTO the ART community on Meta Quest. Discover more than 20 works by each artist in galleries whose colors, skies and architecture reflect their style. Follow each artist\u2019s career and read over 400 artwork analyses in English, French, Spanish and Italian."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.galleriabarattolo.it/into-the-art-privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Vincenzo Bordoni", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.galleriabarattolo.it/intotheart", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "fr_BE", "fr_CA", "it", "es_AR", "es_CL", "es_CO", "es_MX", "es_PE", "es_PR", "es", "es_VE", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1448446231688493"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/908842239_1438449587994313_8246830299953823418_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VEfAEXqEisIQ7kNvwEZJWQz&_nc_oc=AdpjS20L3o2lsfdm09BbDOS6LlPgB3mbjAc8I71sbfJNErABMlfCoKAXPIu5Z2oj1Xo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWmzzIvyDwiPNZ93RBaEqOlrjorU2brE4r652bBODXaXA&oe=6B10362D"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "INTO the ART - MUSEUM", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Travel & Exploration", "id": "726368587961803"}], "release_date": 1795811460, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "1448446245021825", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "1448446225021827", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1194359179594092"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4482537412018643", "locale": "it_IT", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "INTO the ART - MUSEUM", "keywords": ["arte", "museo", "pittura", "vangogh", "monet"], "long_description": "Entra in un museo che cambia con l\u2019artista. Dai cieli vorticosi di Van Gogh al blu della galleria di Hokusai, ogni museo virtuale ha colori, un cielo e un\u2019architettura ispirati allo stile dell\u2019artista a cui \u00e8 dedicato.\n\nEsplora oltre 20 opere per artista e segui un percorso che ne racconta la storia artistica. Scopri come cambia il suo stile nel tempo, quali temi ritornano e in quale contesto sono nate le opere.\n\nLa collezione comprende oltre 400 letture critiche delle opere in italiano, inglese, francese e spagnolo. Soffermati su un dettaglio, confronta due opere o segui l\u2019intera visita al tuo ritmo.\n\nINTO the ART - MUSEUM fa ufficialmente parte della community artistica INTO the ART su Meta Quest.", "short_description": "Entra nei musei virtuali di INTO the ART - MUSEUM, un\u2019esperienza ufficiale della community artistica INTO the ART su Meta Quest. Esplora oltre 20 opere per artista in spazi che ne riflettono lo stile, dai colori al cielo e all\u2019architettura. Segui l\u2019evoluzione di ciascun autore e leggi oltre 400 letture critiche delle opere in italiano, inglese, francese e spagnolo."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2716193902144167", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "INTO the ART - MUSEUM", "keywords": ["art", "musee", "peinture", "vangogh", "monet"], "long_description": "Entrez dans un mus\u00e9e \u00e0 l\u2019image de l\u2019artiste auquel il est consacr\u00e9. Des ciels tourbillonnants de Van Gogh au bleu profond de la galerie de Hokusai, les couleurs, le ciel et l\u2019architecture de chaque mus\u00e9e virtuel s\u2019inspirent du style de l\u2019artiste.\n\nD\u00e9couvrez plus de 20 \u0153uvres par artiste et suivez son parcours de cr\u00e9ation. Au fil des salles, observez l\u2019\u00e9volution de son style, retrouvez ses th\u00e8mes de pr\u00e9dilection et d\u00e9couvrez le contexte dans lequel les \u0153uvres ont vu le jour.\n\nLa collection propose plus de 400 analyses d\u2019\u0153uvres en fran\u00e7ais, anglais, espagnol et italien. Attardez-vous sur un d\u00e9tail, comparez deux \u0153uvres ou suivez la visite compl\u00e8te \u00e0 votre rythme.\n\nINTO the ART - MUSEUM fait officiellement partie de la communaut\u00e9 artistique INTO the ART sur Meta Quest.\nEspa\u00f1ol", "short_description": "Entrez dans les mus\u00e9es virtuels d\u2019INTO the ART - MUSEUM, qui fait officiellement partie de la communaut\u00e9 artistique INTO the ART sur Meta Quest. D\u00e9couvrez plus de 20 \u0153uvres par artiste dans des espaces dont les couleurs, le ciel et l\u2019architecture refl\u00e8tent son style. Suivez son parcours et lisez plus de 400 analyses d\u2019\u0153uvres en fran\u00e7ais, anglais, espagnol et italien."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1894344665068369", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "INTO the ART - MUSEUM", "keywords": ["arte", "museo", "pintura", "vangogh", "monet"], "long_description": "Entra en un museo dise\u00f1ado en torno al artista al que est\u00e1 dedicado. Desde los cielos arremolinados de Van Gogh hasta el azul intenso de la galer\u00eda de Hokusai, la paleta, el cielo y la arquitectura de cada museo virtual se inspiran en el estilo del artista.\n\nDescubre m\u00e1s de 20 obras por artista y recorre su trayectoria creativa. Observa c\u00f3mo evolucion\u00f3 su estilo, reconoce sus temas recurrentes y conoce el contexto en el que se crearon las obras.\n\nLa colecci\u00f3n incluye m\u00e1s de 400 an\u00e1lisis de obras en espa\u00f1ol, ingl\u00e9s, franc\u00e9s e italiano. Detente en un detalle, compara dos obras o recorre toda la exposici\u00f3n a tu ritmo.\n\nINTO the ART - MUSEUM forma parte oficialmente de la comunidad art\u00edstica INTO the ART en Meta Quest.", "short_description": "Entra en los museos virtuales de INTO the ART - MUSEUM, una experiencia que forma parte oficialmente de la comunidad art\u00edstica INTO the ART en Meta Quest. Explora m\u00e1s de 20 obras por artista en espacios cuyos colores, cielos y arquitectura reflejan su estilo. Recorre su trayectoria y lee m\u00e1s de 400 an\u00e1lisis de obras en espa\u00f1ol, ingl\u00e9s, franc\u00e9s e italiano."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "layered_icon_composited.png", "id": "40479230525023761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LAYERED_